        <item>
            <title>0.1.21</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 15:09:47 +0100</pubDate>
            <link>https://thisweek.is</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.1.21</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.1.21</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>ThisWeek Desktop 0.1.21</h2>
<p>Live transcript no longer goes blank when Local Whisper has no model installed.</p>
<ul>
  <li>If Whisper is selected but no model is downloaded, live transcription falls back to ThisWeek automatically.</li>
  <li>Clearer transcript pane status while recording, plus an error when live STT cannot start.</li>
  <li>Settings → Transcription warns when Whisper needs a model download.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
